      "meaning_en": "Good morning, Mrs Aini.",
      "meaning_ja": "おはようございます、アイニさん。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ms-c01-f02",
      "frame": "Apa khabar, (title)?",
      "example": "Apa khabar, Encik Rahman?",
      "meaning_en": "How are you, Mr Rahman?",
      "meaning_ja": "お元気ですか、ラーマンさん。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ms-c01-f03",
      "frame": "Khabar baik, terima kasih. (title) pula?",
      "example": "Khabar baik, terima kasih. Puan pula?",
      "meaning_en": "Fine, thanks. And you?",
      "meaning_ja": "元気です、ありがとう。あなたは？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ms-c01-f04",
      "frame": "Maaf, tumpang tanya.",
